{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07698","headline":"宿天台桐柏观 · 孟浩然","name":"宿天台桐柏观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海行信风帆，夕宿逗云岛。\n缅寻沧洲趣，近爱赤城好。\n扪萝亦践苔，辍櫂恣探讨。\n息阴憩桐柏，采秀弄芝草。\n鹤唳清露垂，鸡鸣信潮早。\n愿言解缨绂，从此去烦恼。\n高步凌四明，玄踪得三老。\n纷吾远游意，学彼长生道。\n日夕望三山，云涛空浩浩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}